sequenceDiagram
    title Diagramme de sequence - Traitement d'une commande
    participant Vendeur as Vendeur
    participant Frontend as Tableau de bord vendeur
    participant OrdersController as Controleur des commandes
    participant OrdersService as Service des commandes
    participant DB as Base de donnees

    Vendeur->>Frontend: Acceder a la gestion des commandes
    activate Frontend
    Frontend->>OrdersController: GET /orders/seller/:sellerId
    activate OrdersController
    OrdersController->>OrdersService: findBySeller(sellerId)
    activate OrdersService
    OrdersService->>DB: Lire les commandes du vendeur
    activate DB
    DB-->>OrdersService: Liste des commandes
    deactivate DB
    OrdersService-->>OrdersController: Resultat
    deactivate OrdersService
    OrdersController-->>Frontend: Liste des commandes
    deactivate OrdersController
    Frontend-->>Vendeur: Afficher les commandes recues

    Vendeur->>Frontend: Selectionner une commande
    Frontend->>OrdersController: GET /orders/:id
    activate OrdersController
    OrdersController->>OrdersService: findOne(orderId)
    activate OrdersService
    OrdersService->>DB: Lire le detail de la commande
    activate DB
    DB-->>OrdersService: Details de la commande
    deactivate DB
    OrdersService-->>OrdersController: Resultat
    deactivate OrdersService
    OrdersController-->>Frontend: Detail de la commande
    deactivate OrdersController
    Frontend-->>Vendeur: Afficher le detail de la commande

    Vendeur->>Frontend: Choisir un nouvel etat
    Frontend->>OrdersController: PATCH /orders/:id
    activate OrdersController
    OrdersController->>OrdersService: updateStatus(orderId, status, sellerId)
    activate OrdersService
    OrdersService->>DB: Mettre a jour l'etat de la commande
    activate DB
    DB-->>OrdersService: Commande mise a jour
    deactivate DB
    OrdersService-->>OrdersController: Succes
    deactivate OrdersService
    OrdersController-->>Frontend: Confirmation
    deactivate OrdersController
    Frontend-->>Vendeur: Afficher le nouveau statut

    Frontend->>OrdersController: GET /orders/seller/:sellerId
    activate OrdersController
    OrdersController->>OrdersService: findBySeller(sellerId)
    activate OrdersService
    OrdersService->>DB: Lire les commandes actualisees
    activate DB
    DB-->>OrdersService: Liste mise a jour
    deactivate DB
    OrdersService-->>OrdersController: Resultat
    deactivate OrdersService
    OrdersController-->>Frontend: Liste actualisee
    deactivate OrdersController
    Frontend-->>Vendeur: Rafraichir l'affichage des commandes
    deactivate Frontend
